  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Youth Seminar 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covering expenses of the International Seminar on Youth Development &#x2013; from Policy to Practice held in Copenhagen on December 4-5th, 2018. The seminar was hosted by the Danish Ministry of Foreign Affairs and was part of the development of tools for youth mainstreaming and youth engagement in Danish bilateral development programs and other development initiatives taking place from September 2018 to January 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
